     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Wild-type or variant ATTR-CM w NYHA I–III HF: a TTR tetramer stabilizer (tafamidis) = indicated to ↓CV morbidity and mortality."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
