     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "TTR stabilization (tafamidis or acoramidis) ↓all-cause mortality and CV hsp; the TTR gene silencer vutrisiran effectively treats the cardiomyopathy."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
